window.products.push({"id":802035,"name":"Rosary Beads Red Crystals High Quality St Benedict Gold Plated Medal Catholic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K66LR+tLL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","description":"Rosary beads are traditional religious attribute in many cultures. People use them to concentrate on the prayer and communication with God. In the ancient times rosary beads were made of natural wood, but modern manufacturers produce them of various materials and even decorate with semi-precious stones. These rosary beads are made of the navy blue crystals. Such rosary beads will become not only a religious attribute, but also a stylish accessory with deep meaning and symbolism. Using such beads during the prayer, you become closer to God and get the protection of the higher powers. The beads are produced in Jerusalem and keep a part of the religious atmosphere of Israel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K66LR+tLL._AC_UL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue White Style","source_asin":"B07BFHHR3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFHHR3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFHHR3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802036,"name":"Antarctic Star Space Heater, Portable Heater Electric Ceramic Fan Small Heaters Indoor Use ETL Certified 1500W/750W with Thermostat, Tip-Over and Over","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FAEnHXuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Control Heater : Adjust the control knob on the right to turn the unit on. \"I\" is for producing heat at 750 watts, \"II\" will produce heat faster and hotter at 1500 watts, and ”Fan” will blow out cool air. Then turn the thermostat knob on the left toward the + sign.you can turn the Temperature Control Switch clockwise, to the highest setting. When the desired room temperature is reached, slowly rotate the temperature Control Switch counter-clockwise until the heater tums off automatically. Overheat protection & Tip-over protection - Thermostat control of the heater will turn the heater off when it reaches a preset temperature and turn the heater back on when the temperature dips below the thermostat setting. When the heater is accidentally overturned or the angle between the heater base and the ground exceeds 45 degrees, the heater will automatically cut off power to protect the safety of you and your family. Compact and Powerful :Dimensions:8.1\" x 6.4\" x 10.6\", 2.9 pounds light weight mini heater easy to carry around with handle.Ceramic space heaters can quick heating within 2S.Heat 200 square feet in seconds. By heating the required small space instead of using other centralized heaters to heat the entire house, helping to save electricity bills. Small weight, easy to carry, suitable for bedroom, living room, study and office, etc. Ceramic Technology :PTC heating element is the abbreviation of ceramic electric heating element, which is more stable than traditional heating element, heating quickly, safe and reliable. The heater has low thermal resistance, rapid heat exchange, automatic constant temperature, no redness on the surface of the electric heating tube heater, and can prevent burns, fires and other safety hazards. At present, it is an ideal electric heating component. Low Noise :The noise this ceramic heater makes is lower than 45 dB, quiet enough for most people to use in a bedroom while sleeping. Provide a quiet space for your comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FAEnHXuSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antarctic Star","source_asin":"B08XB8JRZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB8JRZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB8JRZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
