window.products.push({"id":802050,"name":"YOTAN Mixer Slider Mat with Cord Organizers Compatible with KitchenAid 3.5-5 Qt Tilt-Head Stand Mixer,Kitchen Appliance Sliding Pads Mover Compatible ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pn+aS2-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Move Easily】KitchenAid Stand Mixer and Coffee Makers are usually heavy, not easily to move them out when in need, our mixer slider mat will help you easily move your heavy mixer from the storage corner to the edge of your desired workspace in any directions. Time & efforts saver for your kitchen and will not take up your countertop space. 【Amazingly Versatile】2 different sizes of mixer sliding mats makes it flexibility to fit different appliances, the small size(13.39in*8.07in) is specially designed for KitchenAid stand mixer and fits perfectly with the mixer base. The Large size(16in*14In) can be used for ovens, microwave ovens, toasters, etc. You also can trim the dimensions with your appliance to make it fit. 【Comes With 2 Pack Cord Organizer】 Our mixer slider mats cord keeper is made of high-quality rubber, durable and not easily deformed. The glue on the bottom is a high-quality glue selected for many tests, and it is not easy to fall, and makes organizing your stand mixer convenient and easy. The easy-to-install cord winder for appliances are also suitable for refrigerator, TV, electric kettle, induction cooktops and other household appliances. 【Superb Quality】The mixer mover sliding mat has high-quality rubber fabric and precisely stitched edges keep it from deforming and degumming over time, avoiding fraying and easy cleaning. Also can help you slide the mixer easily without affecting its normal operation, at the same time it will not easily to scratching the countertop. (Note: Please use the cloth side to slide) 【Satisfaction Guarantee】Packing list: 2 x stand mixer sliding mat ; 2pcs Appliance Cord Winder.Feel free to message us through “Contact Sellers” if products don't meet your expectations. you will get your money back or new replacement with no question asked!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91pn+aS2-FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YOTAN","source_asin":"B0BLVDNYT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVDNYT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVDNYT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
