window.products.push({"id":802146,"name":"Rain Bird MSH10PKSX Drip Irrigation Threaded Close Coverage Fan Spray Nozzle, 180° Half Circle Pattern, 4' Spray Distance, 10-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mud-wxoJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Rain Bird MSH10PKSX Drip Irrigation Close Coverage Fan Spray Nozzle, 180° Half Circle Pattern, 4' Spray Distance, 10-Pack. Economical one-piece fan spray jet nozzle provides reliable, uniform Drip irrigation watering. Easily directs water exactly where you need it in a wide variety of planting areas. Delivers a continuous fan-shaped water spray jet in a 180° half circle pattern. Threaded winged base quickly and easily installs into a flexible Drip riser by hand to elevate spray pattern above foliage. High quality Rain Bird riser models available (sold separately) are: RISER1PK, MWSTK-1S, MCSTK1PKS or MPTRISERS. Ideal for gardens, flower beds, mass plantings, ground cover or any closely spaced plants. Constructed of highly durable UV and chemical-resistant materials to withstand adverse conditions. Spray distance of 4' with a flow rate of 13.3 gallons per hour at 25 psi. Convenient plastic bag contains (10) blue-colored spray nozzles. Also available (sold separately) in 10-packs are: 90° quarter circle (MSQ10PKSX), and 360° full circle (MSF10PKSX) patterns to fit your specific landscape needs. Rain Bird \"The Intelligent Use of Water\" From the Manufacturer Rain Bird Corporation is a privately held company founded in 1933 during the agricultural boom in California. We’re recognized as the #1 manufacturer and provider of irrigation products and services in the world. With sales offices around the globe; we offer over 4,000 water-saving irrigation products in more than 130 countries. Since the very beginning, Rain Bird has produced and offered the industry’s broadest range of high-quality irrigation products for: farms, golf courses, sports arenas, commercial developments and homes. Over the past 80-years Rain Bird has received more than 450 patents worldwide. Including the first one for irrigation in 1935 on our original impact-drive sprinkler (U.S. Patent #1,997,901) which revolutionized agricultural food-production and ushered in a new era in irrigation worldwide. In 1990 this original impact sprinkler was designated a historic landmark by the American Society of Agricultural Engineers. Our products cover all aspects of irrigation…timers/controllers, pop-up rotary sprinklers, pop-up spray head sprinklers, sprinkler nozzles, irrigation valves, Drip irrigation, drainage and much more. These products have been chosen and installed worldwide in the largest and most prestigious projects for residential, commercial, agricultural and golf course irrigation. Rain Bird is committed to The Intelligent Use of Water™ extending beyond products to education, training and services for the industry and the community. Our legacy is to design and manufacture only products of the highest value and quality. We’re grateful to have received numerous recognition awards from many of our valued partners. Rain Bird “The Intelligent Use of Water\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mud-wxoJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rain Bird","source_asin":"B07JMBJHY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802146","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JMBJHY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JMBJHY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802147,"name":"Mom's Rack MSH-V103 Luxury Heavy-Duty Commercial Grade Two Tier Spinning Rolling Clothing and Garment Rack, Graphite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3bS6rd8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lighten up your storage space at home or at work. Maximize your valuable store floor display space with ease. Designed to hold up to 180 garments (30 garments for each arm). Moms rolling rack takes about a half less space and it comfortably holds twice as much more garments than a conventional rolling rack. It is cleverly designed to give you the most of capacity with the least of space. Also these rails revolve for easy accessibility and visibility. Need more height? Don’t worry. You can adjust it in 2 different heights of 6.2-feet or 6.4-feet to adopt your need. The rack has 4 rotaing locking casters for an easy transport and securely set in place. The rack has all features to accommodate your battle against the bulge of the closet and the storage space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71u3bS6rd8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mom's Rack","source_asin":"B008H70CWO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008H70CWO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008H70CWO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802148,"name":"Essenso Grenoble 3 Layer Enameled Cast Iron Dutch Oven with Ceramic Coating, 5 qt, Cherry/Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bN03jO9hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Measurements - Handle-to-handle: 12 inches. Rim-to-rim: 9.5 inches. Cooking surface (base): 8.5 inches. Depth: 4 inches. Unique, design cast-iron dutch oven with added functionality, ease-of-use, and beautiful cream interior with cherry glaze. Great for soups, stock, stews, braises – slow cooking and hearty meals! In addition to cast iron’s superior heat retention and even heat distribution properties, Essenso’s 3-layer enameled cast iron dutch oven doesn’t require seasoning, its impermeable surface can be used with acidic foods and wine, and it’s resistant to cracking and rusting. Easily tolerates up to 500F in the oven. Can be used with induction. Smooth surface is more user friendly with glass stoves than traditional cast iron cookware. Enamel and ceramic coating allow for good food release properties when lightly lined with cooking oil and used on medium-low heat. Promotes easier to clean, healthier, residue-free cast-iron cooking. PTFE-free, natural, healthy. If preheated on low-medium heat, cast iron doesn’t require higher heats that lead to food sticking and burning. Lid features moisture marks that lock in flavor and moisture to tenderize meats and prevent drying. A beautiful piece to present on the table straight out of the oven or off the stove. Cast iron heat retaining properties will keep food hot on the table. Great for cooking lamb ragu, pork shoulder, braised short ribs, chicken stock, bread and other great one-pot, hearty meals!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bN03jO9hL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ESSENSO","source_asin":"B0148JGG0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0148JGG0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0148JGG0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802149,"name":"ONEB Gift of love, 2 pack - 12oz Stainless Steel Novelty Wine Tumbler, Double vacuum insulated couple cup，Valentine's Day, girlfriends, the best gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XYuV5GPRL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Best Uses ★ Giving a gift to a special someone for ★ Replacing fragile glass alternatives and unhealthy plastic wine cups – yuck! ★ On an adventure – camping or hiking ★ Boating, out on the deck, or by the pool Unlike other novelty gifts, our high quality decoration is permanently etched resulting in a stylish and durable tumbler that will be enjoyed for many years. The shape looks unique and fits easily in hand. All of our Vintage Aged to Perfection tumblers come individually wrapped in beautiful gift box. Personalized Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler This unique tumbler is a perfect gift idea for any occasion. Give them the best gift on their special day! Get them this Novelty Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XYuV5GPRL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONEB","source_asin":"B07PQV3KC3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQV3KC3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQV3KC3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
