window.products.push({"id":802167,"name":"GSEICE Commercial Ice Cream Maker Mchine, 7 Inch LCD Touch Screen 4.2 to 4.7 Gal/H Soft Serve Machine with Pre-cooling frequency conversion, Soft Serv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1899.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kvzp6-M1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[7-inch touch screen] This soft serve ice cream machine uses a 7-inch Touch LCD screen, and the screen panel is tilted up 42°. You can directly observe and control the quantity, hardness, and temperature of the ice cream without bending over. You will be amazed that the body is only as wide as a sheet of A4 paper, and the ice cream maker is compact and flexible. The body is designed with concave panel size, allowing you to have more space and easily make a large cup of ice cream sundae for kids. [Pre-cooling] This ice cream maker machine is equipped with a 6L capacity hopper for domestic and commercial needs, which is also equipped with a stirrer so that the ice cream slurry can be mixed more fully. it is also equipped with Pre-cooling and fresh-keeping function (freezer tank) to keep the hopper cooling to maker ice cream slurry fresh and not deteriorating, put the raw materials in the hopper overnight ensuring the food safety. [Quiet and Frequency conversion] Adopting world-renowned brand compressors and worm gear reducers, equipped with R290 fluorine-free refrigerant, cooling faster and more energy-saving. The worm gear reducer makes the ice cream machine run quieter, down to 68 decibels. The advanced frequency conversion technology Protect the motor and Control the beater speed, reduces the electricity bill by 2/3 compared with the ordinary ice cream machine, don't have to worry about the high electricity bill. [One-touch cleaning and thaw] The ice cream machine has a one-touch cleaning function and a one-touch thaw function. When cleaning the ice cream machine before making ice cream, just pour water into the hopper and press the cleaning button to automatically clean it. Wait for a while to drain the sewage from the discharge port. If you want to change the taste halfway, just press the thaw button. Wait for a while, and then you can change to other flavor mixtures. [Stainless steel beater] This soft serve ice cream machine adopts a colorful body, and the outer shell is sprayed with anti-corrosion paint, which is beautiful and generous，This soft serve ice cream machine for home and business are good choices. The exquisite discharge port is matched with an ergonomic handle and Stainless steel beater, the operation is smooth. There is a condensate drain under the body to prevent condensate from falling into the machine and causing damage to the machine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kvzp6-M1L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GSEICE","source_asin":"B0C27XZ2SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802167","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C27XZ2SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C27XZ2SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
