window.products.push({"id":802223,"name":"Sandusky SA4V361872-XX Stainless Steel Clear View Storage Cabinet, 4 Adjustable Shelves, 400 lb. Per Shelf Capacity, 72\" Height x 36\" Width x 18\" Dept","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvOS54o0L._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Sandusky Lee SA4V361872-XX Clear View storage cabinet has four adjustable shelves, is made of 18 gauge type 304 stainless steel to resist corrosion and to support a 400 lb. per shelf capacity. This cabinet has two doors with full-length piano hinges for stability and damage-resistant clear acrylic windows for visibility of the contents. This cabinet has a three-point locking system with a door latch and two vertical rods to hold the top and bottom of the door shut for security. Two keys are included for the lock. The shelves in this cabinet adjust in two inch increments to accommodate the height of stored items. The floor surface on this cabinet is raised and can be used as a fifth shelf. This cabinet is commonly used in food service, wash-down, and cleanroom environments, among others. The assembled cabinet measures 72 x 36 x 18 inches (H x W x D). (H is height, the vertical distance from lowest to highest point; W is width, the horizontal distance from left to right; D is depth, the horizontal distance from front to back.) No assembly required. Cabinets are commonly used to store items to help create organized, efficient, and safe work areas. These systems typically consist of a frame with three walls that support adjustable or fixed-position shelves, one or two doors and handles. Added components may include locks for applications that require security and casters or wheels for applications that require mobility. Cabinets are used in a variety of office, industrial, educational, and residential settings. Sandusky Lee manufactures steel storage products for office, commercial, industrial, and educational applications. The company is headquartered in Littlestown, PA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FvOS54o0L._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sandusky","source_asin":"B008KSCBE2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008KSCBE2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008KSCBE2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802224,"name":"ALTA SERIES BY THERMOS Plastic Canteen Bottle 32 Ounce, Matcha Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.75,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GrI5+GHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet your weekend sidekick. The 32oz Canteen Hydration Bottle from the ALTA SERIES BY THERMOS is built with a carry loop that easily straps to a bag or belt, so you can take it everywhere you go. A life in motion stays in motion. The secret to making it all work isn’t slowing things down but being able to keep up. With an eye-catching line of premium hydration bottles, food storage and travel tumblers, the Alta Series is designed to do exactly that. The screw top makes it easy to open whether you’re running errands or getting a workout in. The easy-grip silicone sleeve is also convenient for whatever adventure the day has in store. Convenience at hand and a 32oz capacity ensure you’ll be ready all day, every day. This canteen hydration bottle is extremely durable, dependable and dishwasher safe. Not for hot liquids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GrI5+GHcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B0BHYMQSD5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHYMQSD5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHYMQSD5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
