window.products.push({"id":802312,"name":"XFKJYXGS Indoor Outdoor Heavy Duty Premium Clear Transparent Round Fitted PVC Tablecloth, Round Waterproof Table Cover,Wipeable,Clear Plastic Tableclo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dQpYg6BLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Q: Will this table protector put on a table easily slide off? A: The protector is heavyweight, not like a thin clear tablecloth, it won't easily slide off.  Q: Up to what temperature does it protect a wood table? A: Maximum heat resistant up to 60°C, it can tolerate warm plates & cups. A placemat on top of it is recommended for hot plates.  Q: Will this stick to and/or leave a mark on my wood dining table when we remove it? A: The pad is a bit sticky, if your table is Brand New or just repainted, for security, please cover the CLEAR pad on top of a table cloth or choose a FROSTED one instead, because the painting of a brand new top may not dry enough and it may stick to the item.  Q: Does the plastic table cover have a \"plastic smell\"? A: We select high-quality PVC rolls to get rid of the strange or irritating odor, yet a normal \"plastic smell\" is inevitable and will dissipate soon.  Great for all furniture such as round tables, dining tables, office desks, coffee table, nightstands, writing desks, wooden tables, etc.  You can put the food directly on this pvc table cover;You can divide the food directly on it,will not leave scratches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dQpYg6BLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XFKJYXGS","source_asin":"B09NVPQHTF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NVPQHTF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NVPQHTF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802313,"name":"Goloka Archangel Guardian Incense Series - Set of 7 Packs - Chamuel, Zadkiel, Uriel, Gabriel, Raphael, Jophiel, Michael","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGixVT6FS._AC_.jpg","description":"Angels have fascinated humankind across centuries and cultures. These celestial beings are thought to have never taken a human form, instead are divinely created. The heavens have been their only home since the beginning of time. Angels are thought to provide protection and guidance to human beings on earth, protecting and guiding them on their spiritual path. Archangels are the most powerful of these heavenly beings. They are considered to be the ruling order of angels. Many faiths agree upon the existence of archangels, but there is some disagreement on the exact number of these beings. There are seven archangels that feature predominantly in modern-day belief structures. Archangel Gabriel is known as God's special messenger. His most privileged duty was to announce the birth of Christ. He is often depicted carrying a staff and holding an orb marked with an \"x\" which is the symbol of Christ. Gabriel assists with communication and can help foster communication between people. Gabriel is the patron of letter carriers, telephone and media workers, and all those who convey messages. Those who work in these professions may especially benefit from calling upon Gabriel when they need him. He will help uplift them and give them the strength and protection needed to continue their work. All of humanity may call upon Gabriel when strength is needed, and he especially helps in situations where people need assistance finding their passion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MGixVT6FS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOLOKA","source_asin":"B07ZQT456S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQT456S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQT456S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
