window.products.push({"id":802338,"name":"Handy Living Halsted Armless Transitional Accent Chair, Burgundy And Mardi Gras Gold Striped Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AJRlvhxcL._AC_.jpg","description":"Enhance your home decor with this armless chair in burgundy stripe. Updated transitional armless accent chair has a rolled broad back and deep seat cushion for extraordinary comfort. Ideal for everyday living. This sleek armless design works well as an accent chair for a bedroom or living room. Sturdy hardwood frame construction. Tapered wood legs with a dark walnut finish. Poly-blend fabric is bold stripes in burgundy, gold, fuchsia, orange and a hint of avocado green that is durable and easy to maintain . High resilient thick foam back cushion with a poly fiber wrap to ensure total comfort. Spaciously designed tapered seat cushion offers a wider surface to sit on and is ideal for smaller spaces. The perfect accent chair in any room - or use two side by side to compliment any sofa. Easy assembly. Innovative engineering and design enables this chair to fit through doorways and narrow stairs. Extraordinary comfort, design and color. Eco-friendly and efficient product design uses less fossil fuel based components in construction and delivery. Chair dimension: 27-1/2-inch L by 32-inch W by 35-1/2-inch H. Seat dimension: 21-1/4-inch L by 26-inch W by 19-1/2-inch H. Welcome to Handy Living: Your kind of furniture. Right. Now. Their goal is simple: put full size upholstered furniture in a single box that will ship via common carrier to every doorstep. Handy Living has made everyday furniture exciting and different. They believe furniture should be stylish and fun. It should be affordable. It should be easy to deliver quickly and conveniently in a single box - and ridiculously easy to assemble. And it should be environmentally responsible. Handy Living - Thinking Inside the Box.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41AJRlvhxcL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handy Living","source_asin":"B00A2W2DO2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00A2W2DO2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00A2W2DO2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
