window.products.push({"id":802535,"name":"Italian Ceramic Cap for olive oil bottle with stainless steel dispenser.Hand Painted with a tipical Tuscan decoration with Hills, vineyards, cypresses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LGczxbupL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHO WE ARE ★AUTHENTIC PRODUCT ★100% MADE in the ITALY ★ Cap for olive oil bottle with stainless steel dispenser from the a family team in wich the art of ceramic pottery is handed down from one generation to another Bianco e Nero di Staccioli. We're a family run team of artisan ceramic pottery... Search google for \"Bianco e Nero di Staccioli Sonia\" to see our reviews and learn more about our products. WHAT YOU GET ★Ceramic Cap for olive oil bottle with stainless steel dispenser with the typical decoration of elegant and beautiful landscapes of the Siena countryside, made of sweet hills painted with grain, grass and fabulous Tuscan vineyards. Created with typical colors of the Tuscan, yellow, green, brown and orange countryside.  ★They are unique and collectibles. You can only find them from us.  ★All decorations and ornaments were created by us and are unique. ★Object come individually packaged. ★ This object is HAND PAINTED  ★ Our pottery workshop is specialized in this type of decoration. WHO'S IT FOR ★The cap is completly lead free.  ★Could be an unforgettable gift.  ★Easy to clean and use.  ★Excellent as wedding favors for guest   For orders over 5 pieces you can have a discount and ask for customizations.  The laboratory of Sienese artistic ceramics Bianco e Nero is located in the historical center of Siena, in Tuscany. Our family has been working here since 1984, always keeping attention for detail and love in what we produce.  Thank you very much to those who will buy from us, thus helping Italian artisans Grazie Grazie Grazie from Walter, Sonia e Giada! The decoration of the cap was created by us. This object is HAND PAINTED by Sonia, Walter or Giada Staccioli.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LGczxbupL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bianco e Nero di Staccioli","source_asin":"B01MAYA2DF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MAYA2DF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MAYA2DF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
