window.products.push({"id":802543,"name":"Hosley Cherry Blossom Floral Scent Survival Candle Metal Tin Filled Low Burn Ideal Gift for Everyday Use, Wedding, Special Events, Aromatherapy, Spa, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X2WxPwlGL._AC_.jpg","description":"Hosley 3.88 oz. Soy Floral Cherry Blossom & Orchid Metal Travel Tin Filled Candle. Perfect for weddings, holidays and other events. Hosley's jar candles will add a touch of elegance to your special event, home decor or romantic dinner while creating a subtle and warm ambiance. Our jar candles make the perfect gift for any occasion. These candles will allow you to have a wonderful opportunity in bringing new fragrances into your home as well as a worry free cleanup. Whether you are searching for a colored fraganced candle, or a white unscented candle, Hosley candles will compliment existing decor along with adding a perfect centerpiece to your special event. Hosley candles are equally well suited for to a variety of indoor and outdoor uses, including emergency power outages or simply providing warm, ambient light. Be sure to keep your emergency kit stocked with extra Hosley candles. To maximize the burn of your candle, we suggest trimming and maintaining the wick to 1/8”. Trimming the wick helps maintain an even burn and helps keep the flame from getting too close to the glass. As a general rule, we also suggest using for no more than 4 hours at a time to maximize the burn duration. Always use on heat/flame resistant surface and burn within sight. Keep away from things that can catch fire and away from children and pets. Always keep the wax pool clear of wick trimmings, matches and debris at all times. Product may come in a different packages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41X2WxPwlGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hosley","source_asin":"B09P54N6NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802543","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P54N6NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P54N6NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":802544,"name":"6L Insulated Lunch Bag Collapsible Cooler Bag with Shoulder Strap Adult Lunch Box for Women/Men, Leakproof & Waterproof Soft Liner, for Lunch/BBQ/Fami","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81md8Z7QOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[100% Leak Proof]: The heat welding technology makes the inside of the lunch box waterproof, leak-proof and easy to wipe, so there is no need to worry about soup or beverages leaking into the lunch bag [Say Goodbye to Stale Lunch]: The outer layer of the insulated lunch bag is made of cationic fabric, which is wear-resistant and has a long service life, insulated lining, and padded with 3 mm thick insulating pearl foam between top and inner, which can keep your food cold/warm/fresh up to 8 hours [Foldable Lunch Bag]: The buckle design of the cooler bag allows you to adjust the most appropriate lunch bag size according to the amount of lunch. After you have finished lunch, you can fold the lunch bag and put it away [Convenient to Carry]: The shoulder strap of the lunch bag is adjustable and detachable, which is very convenient to carry. The shoulder strap has the shortest length of 27 inches and the longest length of 52 inches, which fits most people's shoulders. In addition, cotton is added to the handle of the lunch bag to ensure you have a comfortable grip [Multifunctional Use]: The net bags on both sides of the lunch bag can hold water bottles, drinks, etc., and a zipper bag is added on the back of the lunch belt to store mobile phones or cutlery. Our lunch bag has a handle and a shoulder strap, which is very convenient whether you carry the lunch bag or carry it on your back. The lunch bag is the perfect cooler, suitable for outdoor picnics, barbecues, camping, beaches, sports, hiking, road trips, work, school","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81md8Z7QOXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"carinacoco","source_asin":"B09BC8CQ69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802544","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC8CQ69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC8CQ69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
