window.products.push({"id":802671,"name":"Tie Dye Throw Blanket Soft Warm Lightweight Flannel Blanket Grey Tie Dye Cozy Blanket for Home Decor Perfect for Sofa Office Traveling Camping Home (G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pYrk0-D0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<b>Blanket Size: The soft sofa blanket, measuring 50\" X 60\", is large enough for most people. It is very soft, durable, and light enough to provide you with long-term use. Providing you with great comfort on cold winter days or in air-conditioned rooms, shake off the winter chill quickly with a warm and snuggle-worthy flannel blanket. A flannel blanket provides similar softness and warmth for those who are sensitive to natural fibers</b> <b>Lightweight Fluffy Fabric： This extra warm throw blanket features a two-sided pile and 1-inch hem along with double-needle stitching to add to the general sturdiness of this flannel fleece blanket. Soft flannel blanket made of pilling-proof flannel fabric, All layers last for long use and provide fade resistance better than others like a blanket, Keeps you warm and comfortable all year round</b> <b>Perfect for Anywhere: Our bed blanket has a simple and generous design, double-sided plush, soft to the touch, and vibrant colors. You can use it as a bed blanket to add an extraordinary focal point to your room decor, or as a sofa blanket to add elegance, warmth, and interest to your home decor. A high-quality super soft blanket brings you an extremely soft experience, and this blanket will not disappoint you</b> <b>Care Instructions： Machine washable. To prevent wear and tear from damaging the softness of the blanket, we recommend washing the blanket on a gentle cycle, using cold water alone, and drying the blanket using low heat to keep the blanket in immaculate condition for a long time. Do not use bleach, softeners, or high-temperature ironing will reduce the softness of the blanket. Note: Due to slight creases in the vacuum packaging, it needs to be spread out for several days</b> <b>A Luxurious and Warm Gift: The luxurious and warm multi-purpose surface fabric blanket is a perfect choice. It is soft, smooth, and very thick, making it perfect for indoor and outdoor use. The soft and warm throw blanket is ideal for sofas, beds, outdoor camping, picnics, and more. This quality blanket is warm and cozy, it can be a perfect gift for all occasions, Christmas, Father's Day, Mother's Day, and Valentine's Day</b>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pYrk0-D0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sdugrwe","source_asin":"B0BH7SGNGC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802671","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH7SGNGC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH7SGNGC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
