window.products.push({"id":802800,"name":"ecoKiwi Cedar Blocks for Clothes Storage - 20 Pack Cedar Hangers - Natural Cedar Wood for Closet Planks - Pet Safe Hanging Cedar Planks with Sandpaper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mNOVRYxDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😁NO MORE HOLES IN CLOTHES - We've all had that sinking feeling when we try on our favourite item of clothing, only to see it full of holes. Protect your clothes the natural way with our sustainable cedar hangers. We've designed our cedar chips for closets and drawers to incrementally release essential oils. Instead of using low grade plastic, our planks can last years, simply sand the surface to keep the cedar essential oils flowing. 🌎PROTECT OUR PRECIOUS PLANET - At ecoKiwi, we were tired of seeing excess waste and unsustainable products, so we created our cedar closet blocks to be long-lasting and sustainably sourced. Our cedar for clothes storage eliminates the need for any chemicals or plastics to be used. Just pure, sustainable and effective eastern red cedar chips for storage. Join the eco friendly revolution with our cedar blocks for closet products. 👃A REFRESHING & SENSATIONAL SCENT - Cedar has a light, reinvigorating and delicate fragrance. Our cedar wood for closets is specially selected at the source to ensure it's packed with essential oils. Whether in your wardrobe, drawers or cupboard, our cedar for closets will illuminate the atmosphere with a cosseting cloud of fresh cedar to ensure holes in your clothes, odors and excess moisture in your wardrobe are distant memories. 🌲HARNESS THE POWER OF NATURE - Made from eastern red cedar wood that diminishes mustiness and moisture. Our cedar hangers also reduce odors and provide a fresh scent. The delicate oil within our cedar closet lining planks possesses a natural herbal quality. Every 3 months, just give our cedar planks for closets a light sand with the sandpaper provided to ensure it remains effective. ✅MULTIPURPOSE & VERSATILE - One box includes a generous 20 hanger blocks measuring (1.8\"x1.8”x0.35\", hole:0.5”). Our cedar chips can be placed in drawers, closet shelves, on your hangers or anywhere else. As our hangers are 100% natural they can touch any fabric directly and won't stain or emit any smell on clothes. Our cedar wood planks also reduce mustiness, absorb excess moisture and keep your wardrobe smelling delectably fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mNOVRYxDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ecoKiwi","source_asin":"B0BVBW6ZGR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802800","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVBW6ZGR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVBW6ZGR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
