window.products.push({"id":802802,"name":"Winirina Electric Wine Aerator, Bottle Pourer, Automatic Wine Decanter Spout, Dispenser with 2 Silicone Connecting Tubes (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g62uRzYSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Most Frequently Asked Questions: Why use this wine gadget? By encouraging oxidation and evaporation, wine aerators open up a wine’s taste and aroma. Upon pouring, the wine runs through the aerator and out a pour spout into the wine glass. How to clean the aerator after use? Do not clean it under running water directly. Put the tube into a wine bottle filled with clean water, make sure it is sealed, and press the button until clean water comes out of the spout. Why is it not working when the button is pressed? .Check for the batteries first.  .Check the connection between the device and the bottle, make sure they are well connected, the pump only works in a sealed environment. Does it fit all the bottles? Our dispenser only works in a sealed environment, which makes it only suitable for bottle openings of the same size, with a diameter of less than 35mm (inner diameter between 18-19mm). What is it made of? It is made of ABS for its housing, the dispenser (inside) is food grade acrylic and the tube is food grade silicone. All materials are safe to use. Can I use it for white wine or other drinks? Yes, you can use it for any liquid because you can close the switching valve at any time. It's a dispenser when you don't need inflation. How to use it? Just put it on top of the bottle and press the button until there's as much wine as you want. You can see the bubbles of air being introduced into the wine in the spout. Will it vacuum seal the bottle to keep the wine fresh? Sorry, it can only aerate and dispense your wine when in use, you might need a vacuum stopper or even a vacuum pump (which you can find in our store)to seal and preserve your wine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g62uRzYSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINIRINA","source_asin":"B09V28MHFZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-802802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V28MHFZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V28MHFZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
